| prescribed first input | second input | comparable | actual similarity | actual minimum | native heuristic match | actual captured entries |
| --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | --- | ---: |
| AB | AC | true | 5 | 5 | true | 25 |
| AC | DC | true | 5 | 5 | true | 25 |
| AB | DC | true | 4 | 5 | false | 28 |
| 123 | --- | true | 6 | 5 | true | 12 |
| A | BCDFGH | false | 0 | 0 | false | 35 |
\image(figures/match_rating_controls.svg)
// result_end
\caption(Actual nontransitivity, empty-codex and not-comparable controls.)
\alttext(The incomparable length-gap pair is retained in the table and omitted from the score plot.)

> Verification and references

Native tests exhaust19531 short byte words, checking actual codex
phases/decisions/counts against an independent ASCII reference. They compare5000
generated name pairs with independent cancellation, inspect every real
forward/reverse record and test symmetry. Original twelve pairs, all
length-threshold combinations, vowel-separated duplicate consonants, the empty
convention, explicit nontransitivity, NUL, ownership and exact shared quota
boundaries are retained. The shared ten-report batch passes 71 CTest cases, 29
directly instrumented ASan/UBSan cases, 130 compiled and executed public
examples, 598/598 scoped documentation definitions and ten representative
hovers. Independent Python arbitrary-precision, hashlib, sorted-window, RNG,
polynomial, graph and full-assignment references verify 224,229 actual records.
Frozen comparisons preserve ordinary legacy outputs, including selected clique
identities, original density graphs and memetic partitions. Twelve checkout
headers and twelve identically installed headers compile independently; an
installed-header native consumer links and runs. All four complete programs and
all four native figures pass execution and visual review, and HTML/Markdown
exports preserve computed results and identical image bytes. Receipts:
`build/mepml-conversion/batch-224-233/`.

The
[Apache Commons Codec MRA API|https://commons.apache.org/proper/commons-codec/apidocs/org/apache/commons/codec/language/MatchRatingApproachEncoder.html]
identifies the Western Airlines1977 method. This report specifies datamunge’s
actual byte/filter/cancellation conventions explicitly rather than claiming all
MRA implementations agree on preprocessing or invalid/empty input. No unexecuted
corpus-accuracy claim from the legacy report is carried forward.
